# Turn 3: Stone Calendar counts to turn 7, Pen Nib carries its count between fights, Ornamental Fan counts this turn's Attacks.
title Relic Counters
section In fights
character Ironclad
relic add PEN_NIB
relic add ORNAMENTAL_FAN
relic add STONE_CALENDAR
relic-counter PEN_NIB AttacksPlayed 3
act OVERGROWTH
fight SLIMES_NORMAL 5
wait combat-started
hp player 54
floor 11
play STRIKE_IRONCLAD enemy 2
endturn
wait turn-started
play DEFEND_IRONCLAD
endturn
wait turn-started
hand STRIKE_IRONCLAD STRIKE_IRONCLAD DEFEND_IRONCLAD BASH DEFEND_IRONCLAD
play STRIKE_IRONCLAD enemy 2
play STRIKE_IRONCLAD enemy 3
wait 1.5
caption One row per counter relic, with its progress; it flashes when the next card fires it.
shot relic-counters widget relic-counters + player pad 40
